at Chimerstry 9 is basically Sphere magick without paradox, so it alone would allow one to make many absurdly impressive things. One of my greatest concerns regarding the thing is how to properly pronounce Hazimel lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-29T16:10:00-07:00","id":1488403,"title":"","content":"I could see the debate more if it wasn't...Leopold was drawn to New York from Atlanta. Where the tzimisce antideluvian is. But that's me. Seems less of a stretch. I don't see hazimels motivation in what Leopold does. And in the clan novels its clear he is being possessed by his &quot;muse&quot; that he sees.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-29T16:54:37-07:00","id":1488411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Herr Meister</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488269-eye-of-hazimel?p=1488375#post1488375\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, one thing is that Chimerstry 9 is basically Sphere magick without paradox, so it alone would allow one to make many absurdly impressive things. One of my greatest concerns regarding the thing is how to properly pronounce Hazimel lol</div> </div> </div> </div>I went with Haz-eh-Mel.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488269-eye-of-hazimel?p=1488403#post1488403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could see the debate more if it wasn't...Leopold was drawn to New York from Atlanta. Where the tzimisce antideluvian is. But that's me. Seems less of a stretch. I don't see hazimels motivation in what Leopold does. And in the clan novels its clear he is being possessed by his &quot;muse&quot; that he sees.</div> </div> </div> </div>The fact that Leopold is affected in Atlanta and is in Connecticut when he unleash his craziness actually is a reason why I doubt it.<br /> <br /> Mind you, a lot of Leopold's horrific evil can be explained by his being affected by the Week of Nightmares like a Ravnos would be as it would explain why he's going on his killing spree for no reason.<br /> <br /> While the Tzimisce Antediluvian isn't exactly known for the kind of random mayhem that Leopold does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&am